\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Data pipeline for MSTNet training. Sentinel-2 is reduced to soy-masked municipal means; Xavier weather is encoded by a parallel trunk; MapBiomas Solo enters the decoder by late fusion. The decoder prediction $\hat  {y}_{m,y}$ is supervised by IBGE PAM labels at the output. Reported evaluation instead scores individual soy pixels and averages them (Appendix~\ref {app:pixel-pipeline}).}}{3}{figure.caption.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:data-flow}{{1}{3}{Data pipeline for MSTNet training. Sentinel-2 is reduced to soy-masked municipal means; Xavier weather is encoded by a parallel trunk; MapBiomas Solo enters the decoder by late fusion. The decoder prediction $\hat {y}_{m,y}$ is supervised by IBGE PAM labels at the output. Reported evaluation instead scores individual soy pixels and averages them (Appendix~\ref {app:pixel-pipeline})}{figure.caption.2}{}}
